FaroCapital
===========

FaroCapital is a modified work based on Bigcapital, an open-source accounting
and inventory project published by Bigcapital Technologies under the GNU Affero
General Public License version 3.

Upstream project:
https://github.com/bigcapitalhq/bigcapital

This distribution contains changes made for FaroCapital, including Spanish
localisation, branding changes, fiscal/compliance adaptations, VERI*FACTU and
SEPA-related functionality, packaging scripts, and project documentation.

